mg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812170/extras/ecf8dbf1234957941df010d066d4b8cc.poster.avif?t=1695914839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812170/extras/ecf8dbf1234957941df010d066d4b8cc.webm?t=1695914839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812170/extras/ecf8dbf1234957941df010d066d4b8cc.mp4?t=1695914839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The boundary between the spiritual and physical worlds is compromised! Danghosts are popping up all over the island and threatening the fragile balance of serenity. <strong>Join the exorcism school</strong>, solve the mystery and become the best danghost hunter!<br><br>",
